                 ρs = ρ − κS 2 + κ −1 ,            ps = p − κS 2 − κ −1 ,                      (9)
and the physical energy density and pressure satisfy the equation of state
                 p = wρ,                                                                       (10)
where κ = 8π G,  is the cosmological constant, and w is the equation-of-state parameter.
   The spin field equation is given by
                 ∇λ (uλ Sμν ) = 2uρ u[μ ∇|λ (uλ Sρ|ν] ).                                       (11)


