Spin polarization induced by the hydrodynamic




                                                                                                 JHEP07(2021)188
gradients



Shuai Y.F. Liua and Yi Yina,b
a
  Quark Matter Research Center, Institute of Modern Physics, Chinese Academy of Sciences,
