5.2   Shear strength induced polarization and magnetization current term
What is the physical origin of shear-induced quadrupole? Why gω , which quantify the
quadrupole induced by vorticity, is zero at one-loop order, although it does not have to be?
We shall address those questions by considering quantum kinetic theory.
     For simplicity, let us now consider a specific case that fermions under study is mass-
less. Below, we shall only present discussion for fermions as that for anti-fermions is in
