+The focused web search used `"shear" "spin polarization" "pseudo-gauge" Buzzegoli 2022` and `"Kantowski" "shear" "spin polarization"`. Only the PRC article above was acquired. Search snippets, reviews and conference slides were not used as physics evidence. The browser fetch of APS Harvest failed; the ordinary HTTP request succeeded and its byte-level provenance is recorded in [focused_access.json](focused_access.json). No claim of exhaustive literature coverage or absence of all subsequent work is made. All report conclusions concern the inspected evidence.
